  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Cold On The Shoulder**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Ralph's Banjo Special**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **You Won't Be Satisfied That Way**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Old Man At The Mill**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Look Up, Look Down That Lonesome Road**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Ruben's Train**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-04-01.tapers.io** (recommended): audience recording; 23 songs; 146 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: WWG [1]\n- Lindsay Lou sang vocals on some songs, and Michael Trotter Jr. also guested on vocals, marked by asterisk and hash in the notes [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-04-01.tapers.io**: taped by Chase Schultz; source: AUD [1]. Also: Audience recording using a Neumann KM184 stereo pair into a Zoom H4N Pro at 24-bit/96kHz; Transfer path: SD card, backed up to MacOS, tracked in Audacity, exported to FLAC, with ALAC conversion via ffmpeg; recorded by Chase Schultz [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Palisades Tahoe at Alpine Meadows - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/palisades-tahoe-at-alpine-meadows/) [3]",
